                <p>CorpusWright started as a solo project and is maintained, for now, by the person who started it.</p>

                <p>The short version of the origin: as an undergraduate on an iniciação científica project, I was given eight to twelve months to clean a corpus one file at a time; a few weeks of Python reduced the job to days - and the corpus still went barely examined. CorpusWright is the long answer to that experience.</p>

